  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'april fools!' which explicitly frames the entire meme as a joke. This text serves as a deictic marker that the user, as the audience, is meant to recognize and internalize the humorous, satirical context of the image. The projection is onto the textual material, which clarifies the intent and prevents the image from being misinterpreted as a serious accusation.",
